@startuml protocol-send-position-fejl
!include ../../styles/astah-style.iuml
title Send position_Fejl

participant "Mobil-app" as App
participant "Ingestion-server" as Ing

App -> Ing : 1: HTTP POST /positions JSON PositionRequest(sessionId, eventId,\nlatitude, longitude, accuracy, timestamp)
alt ugyldig JSON eller felter mangler
    Ing --> App : 2: HTTP 400 Bad Request JSON ProblemDetail(status, detail)
else sessionId har sendt for tit
    Ing --> App : 2: HTTP 429 Too Many Requests JSON ProblemDetail(status, detail)
else ukendt event eller uden for område/tidsrum
    Ing --> App : 2: HTTP 422 Unprocessable Content JSON ProblemDetail(status, detail)
end

note right of Ing : Hvis positionen afvises, sendes den\nikke videre til RabbitMQ.\nServeren tjekker i rækkefølgen\n400 → 429 → 422.

@enduml
